# Re-include the ONE env file that ships (METH Stage 6): Vite's standard
# dev-mode defaults. It carries two public VITE_ flags and no secret — real
# configuration follows the root rule (.env.example is the only one that
# ships; Guideline R2). Per-machine overrides go in .env.development.local,
# which stays ignored by the root pattern.
!.env.development
